From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tanjilbhuiyan <tanjilbhuiyan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:03:16 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 63/69] arm64: configs: a50_firstlight: enable the SCSC WLBT
 core

Build the Samsung SCSC (Maxwell) core for the Exynos 9610 Wi-Fi/Bluetooth
chip and add /vendor/etc/wifi to the firmware search path on the built-in
command line (the stock bootloader passes firmware_class.path=/vendor/firmware;
ACK accepts a comma-separated list). The NULL-service test client is not
enabled; Wi-Fi and Bluetooth clients follow separately.

Change-Id: I921bba0fafcba3924f1b211a463a75d28e70c365
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig
index 703f4f250..f590b0e58 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/a50_firstlight_defconfig
@@ -57,7 +57,7 @@ CONFIG_ARCH_EXYNOS=y
 # CONFIG_ARM64_POE is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM64_GCS is not set
 # CONFIG_ARM64_SVE is not set
-CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=tty0 loglevel=7 ignore_loglevel"
+CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=tty0 loglevel=7 ignore_loglevel firmware_class.path=/vendor/firmware,/vendor/etc/wifi"
 CONFIG_CMDLINE_EXTEND=y
 # CONFIG_EFI is not set
 # CONFIG_SUSPEND is not set
@@ -140,3 +140,4 @@ CONFIG_INPUT_KEYBOARD=y
 CONFIG_KEYBOARD_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_LEDS_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_LEDS_TRIGGER_TRANSIENT=y
+CONFIG_SCSC_CORE=y
